750.800b - The following food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) bottom inside soda gun holders at the bar (mold); 
B) box fan in dish area (dust);
C) can opener blade and holder (food debris);  and
D) magnetic knife strip (food debris).

Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces between uses/as needed, up to every 4hrs after continuous use for in-sure equipment, to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris.
